            4354,
            4355
        ],
        "nom_orig": "Man",
        "texte_orig": "There[SP]are[SP]people[SP]excited[SP]to[SP]be[SP]evolving[SP]into\nIdealians,[SP]but[SP]where's[SP]the[SP]proof[SP]that[SP]we[SP]won't\nbe[SP]annihilated[SP]along[SP]with[SP]the[SP]Earth?",
