        "texte_orig": "After[SP]the[SP]Grand[SP]Cross,[SP]the[SP]gravitational[SP]pull\nof[SP]the[SP]planets[SP]will[SP]be[SP]off[SP]balance[SP]and[SP]the\nEarth's[SP]rotation[SP]will[SP]stop.",
